{"tmdb_id":1074599,"title":"Trimurthy","original_title":"ತ್ರಿಮೂರ್ತಿ","release_year":1975,"language_code":"kn","language_name":"カンナダ語","industry":"サンダルウッド","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eggExhpXNMoLCTiaQnmR8tfwMU9.jpg","overview":"The film stars Rajkumar, Jayamala, R. Sampath, Balakrishna and Vajramuni. Rajkumar plays 3 different roles in the film- A police inspector Vijay, a hippie vagabond Shekhar, Servant Sheshagiri and the main protagonist Sridhar. The movie was the debut movie of Tamil director C. V. Rajendran in Kannada. The film is divided into 3 stories – Thrimurthy, Undoo Hoda Kondoo Hoda and Aalaagaballava Arasaagaballa. The movie was Parvathamma's first production venture under Poornima Enterprises banner. It was also her maiden distribution venture.","cast":[{"name":"Dr. Rajkumar","character":"Sridhar/Vijay/Shekhar/Sheshagiri"},{"name":"Jayamala","character":"Prema"},{"name":"M. V. Rajamma","character":"Savithri"},{"name":"Sampath","character":"Rajaram"},{"name":"Vajramuni","character":"Srikanth"},{"name":"T. N. Balakrishna","character":"Seetharamaiah"},{"name":"Shani Mahadevappa","character":"Rajaram's House Servant"},{"name":"M.N. Lakshmi Devi","character":"Devaki"}],"songs":[{"title":"Le Le Appanamagale","url":"https://www.jiosaavn.com/song/le-le-appanamagale/PSYKBUxGT1k","singers":"Dr. Rajkumar"},{"title":"Moogana Kaadidarenu","url":"https://www.jiosaavn.com/song/moogana-kaadidarenu/FzACcxp0e1I","singers":"Dr. Rajkumar"},{"title":"Yeko Na Manasothe","url":"https://www.jiosaavn.com/song/yeko-na-manasothe/KlwPBVlWcGE","singers":"S. Janaki"},{"title":"Hanu Maadali","url":"https://www.jiosaavn.com/song/hanu-maadali/Ox4gfyNjBmw","singers":"Dr. Rajkumar"},{"title":"Leleappana Magale","url":"https://www.jiosaavn.com/song/leleappana-magale/Bi87cxx0R1A","singers":"Dr. Rajkumar"},{"title":"Moogana Kaadidarenu","url":"https://www.jiosaavn.com/song/moogana-kaadidarenu/BRgHSUdJYWU","singers":"Dr. Rajkumar"},{"title":"Eako Na Manasothenu","url":"https:/